.Dd June 06, 2026
.Os Linux
.Dt VIMP 1 LOCAL
.Sh NAME
.Nm vimp
.Nd edit the mploop queue
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm vimp
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm vimp
is a tool to edit the queue of
.Xr mploop 1
music player.
.Sh "EXIT STATUS"
.Nm vimp
exits with zero exit status for success. If there's an error such as
invoking
.Nm vimp
with unsupported command-line arguments, it returns with a nonzero
exit status.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Nm vimp
uses the following environment variables:
.Pp
.Bl -column EDITOR -compact
.It Ev VISUAL Ta the preferred visual full-screen editor of the user
.It Ev EDITOR Ta the preferred editor of the user
.It Ev HOME Ta the home directory of the user
.El
.Pp
If neither VISUAL nor EDITOR is set, then "vi" is used as the text editor.
.Sh "SEE ALSO"
.Xr mploop 1
.Sh HISTORY
.Xr mploop 1
was created in September to November 2023. It has been maintained since.
.Sh DISTRIBUTION
.Xr mploop 1
is available at https://github.com/jmtilli/mploop
.Sh BUGS
No bugs known in
.Nm vimp .
